  "note": "The request body each host must build for an OpenAI responses round. Frozen from iOS. `hosts` names the hosts that already produce this body; a case listing only ios is a gap recorded rather than asserted, and `why` says what it is. `body_sha256` is SHA-256 over the body with sorted keys and a forward slash escaped, which is the encoding a receipt binds.",
